The xoshiro128** algorithm by David Blackman and Sebastiano Vigna is based on
their public-domain reference implementation at
https://prng.di.unimi.it/xoshiro128starstar.c . Its authors disclaim all
warranties and liability. The algorithm is used here only for deterministic
replay; it is not a cryptographic random generator.
